        "body": "Pony AI Inc. is a public company with ticker PONY and CIK 0001969302, headquartered in Guangzhou, F4. Its website describes the company as a global autonomous driving technology company founded in 2016 in Silicon Valley. The company says it is developing autonomous driving systems through a core technology it calls \"virtual driver,\" across three business units: Robotaxi, Robotruck, and Personally Owned Vehicles (POV).\n\nThe company states its autonomous vehicles have traveled over 32 million kilometers (over 13 million miles) on urban roads and highways as of April 2024, and that it has secured licenses and credentials to test and operate autonomous driving vehicles in multiple locations worldwide. It describes itself as pursuing safe, sustainable, and accessible mobility and as an industry leader in the commercialization of autonomous driving.",
